{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/4f93e25adc6301daacf90589e250db5e.apng?t=1760583710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/4f93e25adc6301daacf90589e250db5e.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Voices Echo in Your Ears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake, this is what the world has become: eternal night, endless darkness. You don't know what happened, but there's no time to ponder\u2014hunger and various pressures rush over you. You need to survive first.<br>Meanwhile, two strange voices constantly echo in your ears:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/a0612ca51effe12072e9e55b0555684d.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=992 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/a0612ca51effe12072e9e55b0555684d.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/a0612ca51effe12072e9e55b0555684d.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/dff172a3b1870e9d05793459362208d4.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=930 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/dff172a3b1870e9d05793459362208d4.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/dff172a3b1870e9d05793459362208d4.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive and Explore This Dark World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay revolves around survival and exploration. You will explore a world composed of grid cells, collecting food and resources you find to fill your stomach and maintain the beacon's light\u2014don't let it go out.<br>The entire world is shrouded in darkness. You must raise your torch, carefully illuminating the path ahead, slowly piecing together the shape of this world.<br>Darkness is eternal; it will engulf any area without light, including places you've already explored. To maintain and expand the existing faint light, you must continuously seek out and consume resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=938 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold Back the Monster Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness seems far from safe. Monsters attack periodically, keeping your nerves constantly on edge.<br>You must protect the safety of your little home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1020 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=740 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to use resources to construct various buildings, which can help you survive better in this harsh world. As you progress, you will obtain blueprints for a variety of structures.<br>Build light sources, expand your home, and create more possibilities for survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=956 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Strange Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While out exploring, you find an egg. Let's hatch it and see...<br>Oh~ This little one is completely black and seems to be able to collect resources for me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1068 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use seeds to cultivate your own world! Wait for them to grow, harvest them, and let them become the building blocks of your little home in this dark wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=414 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist world composed of grid squares and various icons/symbols:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1122 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer QQ: 1513070485</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Discussion QQ Group: 856717688</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Grid,&quot; the first game born from solo development, is a 2D experience focusing on <strong>survival and exploration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Final Word from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the developer's first game released on Steam, and it's currently under active development. The full version is planned for release in Q4 2025.<br>This game is certainly not perfect. <span class=\"bb_strike\">After playing, you might curse: &quot;What a trash game!&quot;</span> But it carries my hard work and dedication. I will actively improve it! If you have any suggestions for improvement or encounter any bugs, please feel free to contact me. It will help me hone my game design and development skills to bring you better games in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hope you have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/37d1baee2caa9049539c9f70c33ec901.apng?t=1760583710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/37d1baee2caa9049539c9f70c33ec901.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851710?t=1760583710","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/c31600f0f26926ea19b4f285e8cbdbbf5df0af39/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760583710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/1eaad21acad9bbb2f8a60666fbe77da6f9f339ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760583710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/1eaad21acad9bbb2f8a60666fbe77da6f9f339ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760583710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3880460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/4f93e25adc6301daacf90589e250db5e.apng?t=1760583710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/4f93e25adc6301daacf90589e250db5e.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Voices Echo in Your Ears</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake, this is what the world has become: eternal night, endless darkness. You don't know what happened, but there's no time to ponder\u2014hunger and various pressures rush over you. You need to survive first.<br>Meanwhile, two strange voices constantly echo in your ears:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c