\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=938 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/343c88d256350e7597f08291fbd0a9b3.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold Back the Monster Invasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness seems far from safe. Monsters attack periodically, keeping your nerves constantly on edge.<br>You must protect the safety of your little home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1020 height=622 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/8996d046d9f9f79a744849cd2d24a943.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=740 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cee7e4de2a9440b04b691fd96760be56.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to use resources to construct various buildings, which can help you survive better in this harsh world. As you progress, you will obtain blueprints for a variety of structures.<br>Build light sources, expand your home, and create more possibilities for survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=956 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/069d229092a6e9d6868af46a6c68a459.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Strange Creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While out exploring, you find an egg. Let's hatch it and see...<br>Oh~ This little one is completely black and seems to be able to collect resources for me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1068 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/cab32479c69dccc6ecbfd9af56531982.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use seeds to cultivate your own world! Wait for them to grow, harvest them, and let them become the building blocks of your little home in this dark wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=414 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/7f3147fd8b0a26c671a0ea0bc95532d7.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Art Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist world composed of grid squares and various icons/symbols:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" width=1122 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.webm?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/ac2ea5db46194fd8aaee6972bb192b55.mp4?t=1760583710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer QQ: 1513070485</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Discussion QQ Group: 856717688</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Grid,&quot; the first game born from solo development, is a 2D experience focusing on <strong>survival and exploration</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Final Word from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the developer's first game released on Steam, and it's currently under active development. The full version is planned for release in Q4 2025.<br>This game is certainly not perfect. <span class=\"bb_strike\">After playing, you might curse: &quot;What a trash game!&quot;</span> But it carries my hard work and dedication. I will actively improve it! If you have any suggestions for improvement or encounter any bugs, please feel free to contact me. It will help me hone my game design and development skills to bring you better games in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hope you have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/37d1baee2caa9049539c9f70c33ec901.apng?t=1760583710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/extras/37d1baee2caa9049539c9f70c33ec901.poster.avif?t=1760583710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=192 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Moonlight Sand"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851710/5a09fb111e067abef0736bf009c76c2aaf8f9cdb/header.jpg?t=1760583710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3851710/2770310